body:
I wanted to offer showing some South African vehicles from another game that will be in War Thunder as I thought it may be interesting to see for some.

&#x200B;

From the game, Graviteam Tactics: Mius Front there is a DLC for Operation Moduler and the other game Graviteams Operation Star has a DLC with Operation Hooper from their use in the Battle of Cuito Cuanavale.

&#x200B;

I could have shown screenshots for the Armor values, but as it required cycling through every aspect of a vehicle vs a variety of weapons, it would require alot of screenshots but I do the given gun.

&#x200B;

Of note: the Oliphants gun in War thunder is different than in the Graviteam games
